# Training dependencies for the offline LoRA experiment (P04 evidence for T004).
#
# T004 asks the training set to be locked separately from the runtime and test
# sets. What is locked here is the *resolution*; what has not happened is an
# install on a training host, because none is available (D00 blocker `gpu` for
# the full experiment; see product/reports/p01/T004-second-environment.md).
#
# Regenerate with:
#   python -m pip install --dry-run --ignore-installed \
#       --report pip-report-train.json -r requirements-train.in
#   python ../../probes/agent_min/lock.py pip-report-train.json requirements-train.lock.txt
